{"t": 1795078168.621758, "tool": "analyze", "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import curve_fit\ndef run(name,f,p0):\n    try:\n        p,_=curve_fit(f,(A,t),dA_dt,p0=p0,maxfev=20000)\n        r=dA_dt-f((A,t),*p)\n        print(name,p.round(4),np.mean(r**2)/np.var(dA_dt))\n    except Exception as e: print(name,e)\nrun('a/A-bA^n',lambda x,a,b,n: a/x[0]-b*x[0]**n,[2.35,1,2])\nrun('a/A-bA^n+c',lambda x,a,b,n,c: a/x[0]-b*x[0]**n+c,[2.35,1,2,0])\nrun('a/A-bA+c',lambda x,a,b,c: a/x[0]-b*x[0]+c,[2.35,1,0])\nrun('a/A+c-bA^n',lambda x,a,b,n,c: a/x[0]+c-b*x[0]**n,[2.35,1,2,0])\n", "out": "a/A-bA^n [2.36  0.149 3.   ] 7.55247975251973e-24\na/A-bA^n+c [2.36  0.149 3.    0.   ] 3.4784614070818286e-19\na/A-bA+c [0.9472 3.0729 5.1097] 0.03676808038870427\na/A+c-bA^n [ 2.36   0.149  3.    -0.   ] 2.556358295322748e-18\n"}
